{"version":3,"term":{"cols":100,"rows":30,"type":"xterm-256color"},"timestamp":1791840230,"idle_time_limit":2.0,"command":"asciiverse/adventures/stories/stage/so-far/so-far","env":{"LANG":"C.UTF-8","COLORTERM":"truecolor","TERM":"xterm-256color"}}
[0.013, "o", "\u001b[?1049h\u001b[22;0;0t\u001b[1;30r\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4l\u001b[?7h\u001b[?1h\u001b="]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[3dHot, foul, and dark. How did indoor theater become so fashionable? Well enough in spring rain or\r\u001b[4d"]
[0.000, "o", "winter, but not in the thick, dead afternoon of high summer. And though \u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[3mRito and Imita\u001b(B\u001b[m looks very\r\u001b[5d"]
[0.000, "o", "fine, shining with electric moonslight in the enclosed gloom, you're much more aware of being\r\u001b[6d"]
[0.000, "o", "crammed in neck-by-neck with your sweaty fellow citizens.\r\u001b[8dDamn the crowd, in truth: your mood was hot, foul, and dark when you sat down. Aessa was supposed to\u001b[9;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "meet you here. She's made excuses before, and you don't think about what it might mean. Try not to\r\u001b[10d"]
[0.000, "o", "think, rather. Just watch the story. One of your favorites. But it's miserably hot, and you just\r\u001b[11d"]
[0.000, "o", "aren't caught up in the play...\r\u001b[13d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mSO FAR\r\u001b[14d\u001b(B\u001b[mAn Interactive Catharsis\r\u001b[15d"]
[0.000, "o", "Copyright 1996 by Andrew Plotkin.\r\u001b[16d(First-time players should type \"about\".)\r\u001b[17d"]
[0.000, "o", "Release 6 / Serial number 961218 / Inform v1502 Library 5/12\r\u001b[18d"]
[0.000, "o", "Standard interpreter 1.1\r\u001b[19d"]
[0.000, "o", "Warning: @get_prop_addr called with object 0 (PC = d90c) (will ignore further occurrences)\r\u001b[20d"]
[0.000, "o", "Warning: @get_parent called with object 0 (PC = d90f) (will ignore further occurrences)\r\u001b[22d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mLower Theater\u001b(B\u001b[m (on the bench)\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "If nothing else, you have a good seat. The stage is only a few rows to the north. People are jammed\r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", "on benches in every direction; you think the aisle is somewhere to the west.\r\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "The play is into the final act. Rito has finally found out about Imita's affair, and he stalks the\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "stage, whipping voice and hands about himself. A footfall behind him; he turns, and sees Imita. She\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "backs a step at the force of his gaze.\r\u001b[30d[MORE]"]
[2.503, "o", "\u001b[H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m Lower Theater, on the bench                                         (hot, sticky)                  \u001b[30;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[m>\u001b[K"]
