[0.090, "o", "\r\u001b[2d"]
[0.000, "o", "The play is into the final act. Rito has finally found out about Imita's affair, and he stalks the\r\u001b[3d"]
[0.000, "o", "stage, whipping voice and hands about himself. A footfall behind him; he turns, and sees Imita. She\r\u001b[4d"]
[0.000, "o", "backs a step at the force of his gaze.\r\u001b[5d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\u001b[6d"]
[0.000, "o", ">ook at stage"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\r\u001b[7d"]
[0.000, "o", "That's not a verb I recognise.\u001b[K\r\u001b[8d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\u001b[9d"]
[0.000, "o", ">listen\r\u001b[10d"]
[0.000, "o", "You hear nothing unexpected.\r\u001b[11d\u001b[K\u001b[12d"]
[0.000, "o", "The players continue..."]
[0.000, "o", ".\u001b[K\r\u001b[13d\u001b[K\u001b[14d"]
[0.000, "o", "   \u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[3mRito:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\u001b[15d"]
[0.000, "o", "   How come you, harlot? Dare you come this way,\r\u001b[16d"]
[0.000, "o", "   your skin yet dark with Tato's shadow's stain?\u001b[K\r\u001b[17d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\u001b[18;4H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[3mImita:\r\u001b[19d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[m   Young lord, I will not kneel. And shadowed dark,\r\u001b[20d"]
[0.000, "o", "   or white with rays of moon or sun or moon,\u001b[K\r\u001b[21d"]
[0.000, "o", "   my flesh is mine. Or nearly so; I find --\u001b[K\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.001, "o", "   \u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[3mRito:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\u001b[24d   Say on! What more has hated Tato done?\u001b[K\r\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "You shake your head, trying to net your straying thoughts, and catch a flash of copper hair. A few\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "rows back, by the aisle -- Aessa couldn't have shown up and \u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[3mnot\u001b(B\u001b[m seen you, could she? She wouldn't be\u001b[28;1Havoiding you"]
[0.000, "o", ".\u001b[K\r\u001b[30d>\u001b[K"]
[2.412, "o", "s"]
[0.091, "o", "t"]
[0.090, "o", "a"]
[0.091, "o", "n"]
[0.090, "o", "d"]
[0.091, "o", " "]
[0.090, "o", "u"]
[0.091, "o", "p"]
[0.091, "o", "\r\u001b[2d\u001b[15M\u001b[1;15H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m              \r\u001b[16d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mYou push yourself to your feet. Naturally, your spot on the bench instantly vanishes in the crush.\u001b[18;4H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[3mImita:\u001b[19;4H\u001b(B\u001b[mOh, do not hate. For dazzled though she was,\u001b[20;4H"]
[0.000, "o", "Imita's put him by; he's naught and gone --\u001b[21;4H"]
[0.000, "o", "But nearly, for she carries Tato's son.\u001b[23;4H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[3mRito:\u001b[24;4H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mShe -- you -- you say -- aah!\u001b[26;4H"]
[0.000, "o", "(He rushes from the stage.)\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "\"Out of the light, horse-muck,\" growls someone behind you, sullenly.\r\u001b[30d>"]
[2.412, "o", "w"]
[0.091, "o", "e"]
[0.090, "o", "s"]
[0.091, "o", "t"]
[0.091, "o", "\r\u001b[2d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[15M\u001b[A\u001b[C"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7mTheater Near Aisle\r\u001b[16d\u001b(B\u001b[mYou push through the crowd...\r\u001b[18d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mTheater Near Aisle\r\u001b[19d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mYou are adrift in a sea of knees. People squirm to give you room, glowering politely around you as\r\u001b[20dthey try to watch the play. The aisle is nearby, west, and your seat is far in to the east.\r\u001b[21d"]
[0.000, "o", "Warning: @get_child called with object 0 (PC = f983) (will ignore further occurrences)\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "Imita turns and pleads her dilemma to the audience: \"What scourge, what scourge I bear, from what\r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", "red star / So near to happiness, and yet so far?\" She is in despair; but this whispered soliloquy is\u001b[25;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "soon interrupted by voices rising in the wings. Rito, in a fury, backs Tato onto the stage.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "You can no longer see Aessa, if you did at all. \"Sit down, horse-head,\" mumbles someone behind you,\r\u001b[28dsourly.\r\u001b[30d>"]
[2.412, "o", "l"]
[0.091, "o", "o"]
[0.091, "o", "o"]
[0.090, "o", "k"]
[0.091, "o", "\r\u001b[2dWarning: @get_child called with object 0 (PC = f983) (will ignore further occurrences)\r\u001b[3d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\u001b[4d"]
[0.000, "o", "Imita turns and pleads her dilemma to the audience: \"What scourge, what scourge I bear, from what\r\u001b[5d"]
[0.000, "o", "red star / So near to happiness, and yet so far?\" She is in despair; but this whispered soliloquy is\u001b[6;1Hsoon interrupted by voices rising in the "]
[0.000, "o", "wings. Rito, in a fury, backs Tato onto the stage.\r\u001b[8d"]
[0.000, "o", "You can no longer see Aessa, if you did at all. \"Sit down, horse-head,\" mumbles someone behind you,\r\u001b[9d"]
[0.000, "o", "sourly.\u001b[K\r\u001b[11d"]
[0.000, "o", ">look\u001b[K\r\u001b[13d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mTheater Near Aisle\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\u001b[14d"]
[0.000, "o", "You are adrift in a sea of knees. People squirm to give you room, glowering politely around you as\r\u001b[15d"]
[0.000, "o", "they try to watch the play. The aisle is nearby, west, and your seat is far in to the east.\r\u001b[16d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\u001b[17;4H\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[3mRito (icily):\r\u001b[18d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[m   Stench of the grave on the day of your birth\r\u001b[19d"]
[0.000, "o", "   Shadows the shape first your eyes ever saw\u001b[K\r\u001b[20d"]
[0.000, "o", "   Curdled with gall was the milk on your lips\u001b[K\r\u001b[21d"]
[0.000, "o", "   Foul luck...\u001b[K\r\u001b[23d   \u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[3mImita:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[24;16H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1K "]
[0.000, "o", "Enough!\u001b[K\r\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\u001b[26;4H\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[3mRito:\u001b[27;24H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1K It is blood I will have"]
[0.000, "o", ",\u001b[K\r\u001b[28d   Goo"]
[0.000, "o", "d red to flood the black ebb of your luck.\r\u001b[30d>\u001b[K"]
[2.413, "o", "n"]
[0.090, "o", "o"]
[0.091, "o", "r"]
[0.091, "o", "t"]
[0.090, "o", "h"]
[0.091, "o", "\r\u001b[2d\u001b[K\u001b[3;4H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[3mImita:\u001b[4;16H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1K "]
[0.000, "o", "Enough!\u001b[K\r\u001b[5d\u001b[K\u001b[6d"]
[0.000, "o", "   \u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[3mRito:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[7;25H"]
[0.000, "o", "It is blood I will have,\r\u001b[8d"]
[0.000, "o", "   Good red to flood the black ebb of your luck.\u001b[K\r\u001b[9d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\u001b[10d>north\r\u001b[11d"]
[0.000, "o", "If you start crawling over people in here, you're likely to be hung from a scene-scaffold before the\u001b[12;1Hplay is over.\r\u001b[13d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\u001b[14d"]
[0.000, "o", "   \u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[3mTato (drawing his sword):\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\u001b[15d"]
[0.000, "o", "   I did not look to draw this moment here;\u001b[K\u001b[16;4H"]
[0.000, "o", "Imita's choice has whipped my tongue and soul;\u001b[17;4H"]
[0.000, "o", "I would withdraw. But if my mistress' word\u001b[18;4H"]
[0.000, "o", "Would leash me, yet the wolfish howl will stir\u001b[19;4H"]
[0.000, "o", "The blood of any hound. Attend thy sword!\u001b[K\r\u001b[20d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\u001b[21;4H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[3mImita:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[22;4H"]
[0.000, "o", "Cease you this play --\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\u001b[24;4H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[3mTato:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[25;29H"]
[0.000, "o", "In the poisonous marl\u001b[26;4H"]
[0.000, "o", "And the tangling thorn fell the step you first took...\r\u001b[27d\u001b[K\u001b[28;4H"]
[0.000, "o", "(Rito draws as well, and Tato begins circling him, still intoning the ritual.)\r\u001b[30d>"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K"]
